{"reviewId": "245344781_80mhKtNVN", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "假如你开了一家服装店（消费品行业）。一开始，做衣服的工厂（半消费品行业）发现订单变多了，就会多进布料（半投资品），而生产布料的纺织厂（投资品相关行业）就会多买织布机（投资品）。等纺织厂的机器都运转起来，布料大量生产出来，服装厂就能做更多衣服，你的服装店也就有更多的货可以卖了。当越来越多的企业都开始这样增加投资和生产，经济就慢慢从复苏走向一个更长期的快速增长阶段。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "13968-14054", "abstract": "库存转换将是一个投资品先行的进程，特别是中游偏下的行业将更加明显，我们提出了投资品→半投资品→半消费品→消费品的演进逻辑。当库存重建展开后，向中周期的过渡从理论上就开始了。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 11, "reviewId": "245344781_80mhKtNVN", "userVid": 245344781, "topics": [], "createTime": 1747986711, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 11, "chapterTitle": "06 结构主义的薪火 周期波动、结构演进与制度变革", "author": {"userVid": 245344781, "name": "之乎者也", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/r3pgDYia6HarM6mCMSTDRgkmyEPtKGat1HpuVVAOwy4RqSfJngxK5x4JI6wwVcDCPfvibktD4wR44/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "之乎者也", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "天地不限于人，而人自限于天地", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "读万卷书", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-365", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 365}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 13, "likes": [{"userVid": 29243174, "name": "再也不打游戏了！！", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0017-r4m1zPtrjDIyIiNLHs112f4/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "再也不打游戏了！！", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-10", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 10}}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "你这个说法好像不对，因为原材料需求不足，导致厂家减产，供应下降后期货上涨（投资品），市场需求增加后带动现货上涨（半投资品），然后是半成品上涨（半消费品），最后是成品。\n按你说的对应：投资品（棉花期货），半投资品（棉花现货），半消费品（胚布），消费品（成衣）。\n一家之言", "reviewId": "245344781_80mhKtNVN", "commentId": "245344781_80mhKtNVN_c66920859_84mjFXSZX", "userVid": 66920859, "createTime": 1762074935, "likesCount": 4, "isLike": 0, "author": {"userVid": 66920859, "name": "大河奔流", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/Ib5852jAyb83YJgia42gDZWpgSJujHsyADgwcd65Rre6WNVEH63maBQ/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "一个人的判断能力受限于他的认知范围", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M14-0-100", "desc": "拯救书荒", "title": "好书导读人", "levelIndex": 100}}}], "dislikeCount": 0, "synckey": 1785833211}